      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "A couple, both well over a hundred, sit in a lawyer's office.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "ded",
      "text": "We want a divorce.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "nachalnik",
      "text": "A divorce? After all these years? At your age?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "nachalnik",
      "text": "Have you really thought this through?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.7,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "tyoshcha",
      "text": "Oh, for ages. We were just waiting for the children to die.",
